        "markdown": "# Lionel Validation Study 08\n\n## Layered Live Monologue\n\nA roughly **1:37:14** live stream combining free-speech argument, Candace Owens commentary, historical precedent, Tyler Robinson trial analysis, live chat, satire, and coalition synthesis.\n\n**Duplicate check:** distinct from the prior specimens.  \n**Sequence controller:** `live-thematic-thread`  \n**Navigation mode:** `branch-and-return`  \n**Persistent top-level storylines:** several  \n**New episode family required:** probably no\n\n`DECLARE LAYERS -> OPEN THREAD -> BRANCH -> RETURN -> SWITCH STORYLINE -> SIMULATE -> AUDIT -> SATIRIZE -> SYNTHESIZE -> COMMUNITY CLOSE`\n\nStudy 08 strongly validates the live-navigation model from Study 06.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786069297959,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
