        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Attribution Boundary\n\n**Duration represented:** approximately 1:37:14.\n\nLionel opens by promising a layered discussion involving Erica Kirk, Candace Owens, changing alliances, and people behaving differently from how he previously understood them. \n\nThe transcript contains disputed factual claims, legal opinions, historical claims, political allegations, speculation, satire, and live audience contributions. Those remain attributed to the speaker or quoted participant.\n\nThe study records rhetorical and navigational structure rather than treating the episode's claims as independently established facts.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786069297959,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
