        "markdown": "# 1 · Layered Hook and Sponsor\n## 0:00–1:55\n\nLionel promises an unusually important and layered episode involving Erica, Candace, changing allegiances, and what he sees as strange behavior by former ideological allies. He then moves immediately into a Noble Gold advertisement. \n\n**Existing production grammar:**\n\n`alarm or importance hook -> sponsor -> editorial body`.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
