        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-08"
        },
        "markdown": "# 2 · Declare the Navigation Method\n## 1:55–5:46\n\nLionel says the story changes day to day and explicitly separates several concurrent storylines: the whodunit, Tyler Robinson's trial, TPUSA and Erica, Candace, and a wider speech issue. \n\nHe then warns that his delivery jumps around because many issues are happening at once and says a simple `first this, then that` structure does not match how he thinks. \n\n**Function:** make the episode's navigation contract explicit before using it.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786069297959,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
