        "markdown": "# 10 · Satirical Expert Simulation\n## 1:13:41–1:24:42\n\nLionel asks who on the opposing side can make the strongest substantive case, then launches into an extended improvised parody of a supposed tactical expert defending the prosecution narrative. The roleplay exaggerates credentials, technical confidence, mannerisms, and anti-Candace rhetoric until the persona itself becomes the argument. \n\n**Important compression:** this does not require `Lionel Satirizes Tactical Expert` as a new class.\n\nIt fits the deeper primitive already emerging:\n\n## `Lionel Simulates a Scenario`\n\nwith `role = parodic-opponent-model`.",
