        "markdown": "# 11 · Influence, Realignment, and Community Close\n## 1:24:42–1:37:14\n\nAfter more comedy and audience interaction, Lionel returns to Candace's influence, describes her as unusually loved and powerful, and interprets her departure from Daily Wire as a development that ultimately strengthened her position. \n\nHe uses another confrontation analogy, returns to the collapse of old left-right boundaries, describes new allies and enemies, thanks Candace and the audience, asks viewers to subscribe and continue the effort together, and closes with the recurring show signoff. \n\n**Existing moves:** coalition realignment, analogy, audience-to-community conversion, ritual outro.",
