        "markdown": "# 🧬 Observed Grammar\n\n**importance hook -> sponsor -> declare multiple storylines -> establish master thesis -> push branch -> historical precedent -> return -> live participant event -> switch to trial storyline -> simulate courtroom -> switch to research-network storyline -> historical analogy -> persona audit -> parodic simulation -> return to influence and coalition theme -> community close**\n\n## Sequence controller\n`live-thematic-thread`\n\n## Navigation mode\n`branch-and-return`\n\n## Composition fit\n`Lionel Live Monologue`\n\nThis is strong evidence that **Study 06's navigation pattern generalizes beyond the specific realignment episode**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
