        },
        "markdown": "# ✅ Validation Result\n\nStudy 08 fits overwhelmingly into existing machinery.\n\n## Strongly validated\n- `Lionel Live Monologue`\n- `sequenceController = live-thematic-thread`\n- `navigationMode = branch-and-return`\n- Topic Thread / Thread Branch / Return Point\n- live chat as navigation input\n- information-network mapping\n- historical analogy\n- evidence audit\n- juror proof test\n- persona commentary\n- coalition realignment\n- audience-to-community close\n\n## Refinements rather than new families\n- multiple persistent peer storylines suggest a `threadSet`\n- scenario simulation absorbs several earlier candidate classes\n- live presence of a subject may be a small production event\n\nThe transcript is broad in **content**, but the grammar barely broadens at all.",
