      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-08"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Eight Studies\n\n## 01 · Thesis Monologue\nCentral proposition, mostly linear.\n\n## 02 · Hosted Forensic Commentary\nEvidence audit inside another host's container.\n\n## 03 · Annotated Media Reaction\nOne source timeline governs sequence.\n\n## 04 · Adversarial Media Audit\nOpponent argument becomes the object of proof-oriented inspection.\n\n## 05 · Curated Media Mosaic\nMedia queue governs sequence.\n\n## 06 · Live Associative Monologue\nThematic thread survives chat and associative branches.\n\n## 07 · Preventive Scenario Monologue\nExisting thesis family plus scenario simulation and proposed countermoves.\n\n## 08 · Layered Live Monologue\nStudy 06 navigation recurs with different subject emphasis and several explicitly named persistent storylines.\n\n## Result\nThe last two specimens add mostly **role values and state refinements**, not composition families.\n\nThat is strong convergence evidence.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
