      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-08"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🗜️ Current Compressed Grammar\n\n## Episode container\nLionel-owned, guest-owned, live, recorded, sponsor and outro structure.\n\n## Sequence controller\n- thesis\n- evidence audit\n- host interaction\n- source timeline\n- opponent argument\n- media queue\n- live thematic thread\n\n## Navigation mode\n- linear\n- serial\n- source-bound\n- queue-driven\n- branch-and-return\n\n## Navigation state\n- thread set\n- active thread\n- suspended thread\n- branch\n- return point\n- queue item\n- continuation state\n\n## Stable rhetorical operations\n- frame\n- define standard\n- audit evidence\n- add context\n- analogize\n- identify pattern\n- map actors\n- comment on media\n- synthesize\n- qualify uncertainty\n- simulate scenario\n- direct or incorporate audience\n\n## Shared analytical primitives\nSource, Timed Segment, Transcript Segment, Claim, Evidence Item, Hypothesis, Person, Organization, Topic, Thread, Actor Field, Research Funnel, Coalition.\n\nEight specimens now compress into a relatively small machine.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
